  "2026-05-14T08:27:36.484Z",codex-agent,"Progress 2026-05-14: bare-core pruning removed core reindex command registration and forced core search command dispatch to keyword mode in src/cli/register-list-query.ts; MCP pm_run static reindex dispatch removed from src/mcp/server.ts so package-owned advanced search actions route dynamically. Validation: pnpm build and node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/contracts-command.spec.ts tests/integration/release-readiness-runtime.spec.ts passed."
  "2026-05-14T09:05:57.913Z",codex-agent,"Progress 2026-05-14: added new TypeScript first-party package pm-search-advanced that provides package-owned advanced search and reindex surfaces ( and ) while core search remains keyword-only and bare core keeps reindex unavailable by default. Package runtimes load SDK primitives deterministically via PM_CLI_PACKAGE_ROOT. Updated bundled package catalog/install-all expectations and release-readiness coverage to verify bare-core unknown reindex plus restored package behavior after install. Validation passed: pnpm build and node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/package-manifest.spec.ts tests/unit/extension-command.spec.ts tests/unit/builtin-extension-entrypoints.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk-index.spec.ts tests/unit/contracts-command.spec.ts tests/integration/release-readiness-runtime.spec.ts tests/integration/cli.integration.spec.ts."
  "2026-05-14T09:06:04.287Z",codex-agent,"Correction: package-owned advanced surfaces are commands search-advanced and reindex (without core fallback)."
  "2026-05-14T10:10:52.808Z",codex-package-refactor,"Final verification 2026-05-14: search-advanced extraction remains green under full coverage (1299/1299), package smoke, package-first dogfood (bare core unknown reindex before install + reindex after install all), and release gates with telemetry/sentry thresholds."
